    <body>
      <div type="work" n="89">
        <pb n="129"/>
        <head>89 — ii — VII. — <quote>Clap hands all ye peoples</quote><ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a1" target="#n1" n="1"/>.</head>
        <div type="section">
          <ab n="1">O the riches of the words! O the height of the God-befitting sentiments! These are [in truth evangelical<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a2" target="#n2" n="2"/>, which quicken us<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a3" target="#n3" n="3"/> who are dead in works of sin and raise us with <persName>Christ</persName>, and in a fashion make [us fly and float in the air in our mind<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a4" target="#n4" n="4"/>, <pb n="130"/> and ascend with them to heaven above; and they cry in our deaf and dead ears<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a5" target="#n5" n="5"/> with a voice louder than that of a trump, saying, <quote>Mind things above, and not things on the earth. Seek<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a6" target="#n6" n="6"/> and meditate upon things above, where <persName>Christ</persName> is, sitting at the right hand of the Father; in order that, when he himself who hath come and [is to<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a7" target="#n7" n="7"/> come is again revealed at his second coming, ye also may be revealed with him in glory</quote>, according to the abundance of his great mercy.</ab>
        </div>
      </div>
      <noteGrp>
        <note xml:id="n1" target="#a1" n="1"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 129, n. 8</orig></choice> Ps. xlvii, 2.</note>
        <note xml:id="n2" target="#a2" n="2"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 129, n. 9</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>verily and truly evangelical (words)</quote>.</note>
        <note xml:id="n3" target="#a3" n="3"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 129, n. 10</orig></choice> Eph. i, 22 — ii, 2.</note>
        <note xml:id="n4" target="#a4" n="4"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 129, n. 11</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>the mind to fly and lift it up</quote>.</note>
        <note xml:id="n5" target="#a5" n="5"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 130, n. 1</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>hearing</quote>.</note>
        <note xml:id="n6" target="#a6" n="6"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 130, n. 2</orig></choice> Col. iii, 1-3 (verbal diff.).</note>
        <note xml:id="n7" target="#a7" n="7"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 130, n. 3</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>who shall again</quote>.</note>
      </noteGrp>
    </body>
